# Same retained session, a fresh resident and a fresh Turnstone process.
settle 100
key escape
act Ask retained text
settle 100
settle 30
assert text Connected to resident inference.
assert text Past asks
click surface:contributed role:button Reopen: What is the Pelican observatory's access word? Answer in one short sen (Finished)
settle 30
assert text Finished
assert text amberstone
click surface:contributed role:button Source 1:
settle 30
assert text Retained source version
assert text amberstone
capture 06_reopened_exact_source
log Past answer and exact source reopened after both processes restarted
